{"title":"2017 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all real triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c73ed093cc73a8d9a14185fa525e7067e5c3725d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> which are solutions to the system:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0acc7cf8414d42f76fa843714f4034c6df55c33b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 + x^2y + x^2z = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1abe91b0e293974e90f029188f5553b416ed0ed6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^3 + y^2x + y^2z = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/b/e7bef18c48175da69cd2bf18158ef51f37edc32a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^3 + z^2x + z^2y = 250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"165\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/899d41029683fdbdc6b45f22b1cba66ab1ce5665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/905c22232f5bb60b529c2241abffe49a9380efcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{40}{3}} ,\\sqrt[3]{45},\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{5^4}{3}})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"156\" height=\"43\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/5/1f5ffbd968f934c954cd5346a24ca580d95a47ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt[3]{20},-\\frac{3\\sqrt[3]{20}}{ 2} , \\frac{5\\sqrt[3]{20}}{ 2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"171\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2017 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2017 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2017 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"ht